        </p>
        <ul class="guardrails">
          <li>
            <span class="guardrail-title">No copying.</span>
            Generated emails reuse a real attack's structure, never its words.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="guardrail-title">No real people.</span>
            Names and company details only appear as dynamic variables.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="guardrail-title">No free-text editing.</span>
            Analysts can tweak variables inline or regenerate, but they can't rewrite the body by hand.
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="guardrail-title">Graceful fallback.</span>
            When a customer's detection history is too thin, environment-based options switch off, and
